| BOOT SMILE -- a white smile on black at power-on, instead of the Elektron logo: it grows from
| the centre, stays a moment, then melts down off the screen. The LED wave of the stock boot stays.
|
| GENERATED by tools/bootsmile/gen_bootsmile.py from tools/bootsmile/bootsmile_code.s: edit those,
| not modules/bootsmile/bootsmile.s.
